   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello everyone.<div><br></div><div>I am doying a shiny app to generate reports automatically. I followed the procedure on &quot;<a href=\"http://rmarkdown.rstudio.com/articles_docx.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rmarkdown.rstudio.com/articles_docx.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792388447188000&amp;usg=AOvVaw25hLMTzhOU57xEm68_U3lB\">http://rmarkdown.rstudio.com/articles_docx.html</a>&quot; and created an external docx reference for my report (for centralized titles, font colors, etc).</div><div><br></div><div>When I press the knit button on rstudio everything works fine. The styles are normally passed from the reference document to the final report.</div><div><br></div><div>However, when I tried to implement this on shiny app the final report is generated without any style. It seems that knit is not reading the reference document. I imagine that this is working directory issue but I really dont know what to do...</div><div><br></div><div><b>ui</b></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">downloadButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;downloadReport&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br></div><div><div><b>server</b></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">  output$downloadReport </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> downloadHandler</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    filename </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;wind.report&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$projname</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sep </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;.&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">switch</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$format</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Word</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;docx&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">},</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    content </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">file</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\">      <br>      library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rmarkdown</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rmarkdown</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">render</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;24_12_report.Rmd&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">switch</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$format</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Word</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> word_document</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      file</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rename</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> file</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div></div><div>I put everything in the same folder: Rmd file, server.R, ui.R and reference docx...</div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "C7pFk4kcBAAJ",
   "from": "Yihui Xie",
   "author": "85e053d519f0f372",
   "date": "2016-10-17T17:58:37Z",
   "subject": "Re: Shiny + knit not reading docx reference",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "You can try to change\r<br>\r<br>  switch(input$format, Word = word_document())\r<br>\r<br>to\r<br>\r<br>  switch(input$format, Word = &quot;word_document&quot;)\r<br>\r<br>Regards,\r<br>Yihui\r<br>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "\r<br>\r<br>On Mon, Oct 17, 2016 at 12:22 PM, Rafael Batista &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rafael...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:\r<br>&gt; Hello everyone.\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; I am doying a shiny app to generate reports automatically. I followed the\r<br>&gt; procedure on &quot;<a href=\"http://rmarkdown.rstudio.com/articles_docx.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rmarkdown.rstudio.com/articles_docx.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792388447189000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2myWxP-irHE7M4SNf_RTgX\">http://rmarkdown.rstudio.com/articles_docx.html</a>&quot; and created\r<br>&gt; an external docx reference for my report (for centralized titles, font\r<br>&gt; colors, etc).\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; When I press the knit button on rstudio everything works fine. The styles\r<br>&gt; are normally passed from the reference document to the final report.\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; However, when I tried to implement this on shiny app the final report is\r<br>&gt; generated without any style. It seems that knit is not reading the reference\r<br>&gt; document. I imagine that this is working directory issue but I really dont\r<br>&gt; know what to do...\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; ui\r<br>&gt; downloadButton(&#39;downloadReport&#39;)\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; server\r<br>&gt;   output$downloadReport &lt;- downloadHandler(\r<br>&gt;     filename &lt;- function() {\r<br>&gt;       paste(&#39;wind.report&#39;,input$projname, sep = &#39;.&#39;, switch(input$format,\r<br>&gt; Word = &#39;docx&#39;))\r<br>&gt;     },\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;     content &lt;- function(file) {\r<br>&gt;       library(rmarkdown)\r<br>&gt;       out &lt;- rmarkdown::render(&#39;24_12_report.Rmd&#39;, switch(input$format, Word\r<br>&gt; = word_document()))\r<br>&gt;       file.rename(out, file)\r<br>&gt;     }\r<br>&gt;   )\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; I put everything in the same folder: Rmd file, server.R, ui.R and reference\r<br>&gt; docx...\r<br>&gt;\r<br>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "&gt; --\r<br>&gt; You received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups\r<br>&gt; &quot;Shiny - Web Framework for R&quot; group.\r<br>&gt; To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an\r<br>&gt; email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">shiny-discus...@googlegroups.com</a>.\r<br>&gt; To view this discussion on the web visit\r<br>&gt; <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/6a0e21fa-3947-4747-928e-833d8da14399%40googlegroups.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/6a0e21fa-3947-4747-928e-833d8da14399%2540googlegroups.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792388447189000&amp;usg=AOvVaw292LUNwV1Gk03MANsyh9zS\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/6a0e21fa-3947-4747-928e-833d8da14399%40googlegroups.com</a>.\r<br>&gt; For more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792388447189000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3eDl7emicU-7ofBbosaHbr\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.\r<br>"
